        A: "Risk 1 (Oracle Data Manipulation) — the 'oracle problem' is the most severe risk because the smart contract's payment decision depends entirely on the integrity of the WMS data feed; a compromised WMS can trigger unauthorized payments at scale with no human review between the data input and the payment execution, and the fraudulent transactions would appear as legitimate, system-processed payments on the blockchain",
